  "summary": "Updates the Guix time-machine commit to 60f6956aeffa7f30285745bd0ea615e9acfc74f8 and bumps the python-lief lint requirement to 0.17.6. In manifest_gui.scm, it disables test suites for transitive dependencies (python-psutil, python-pytest-xprocess, and python-sh) pulled in by python-lief and nsis-x86_64.",
